  "id": "black-bean-and-spicy-beef-pasta",
  "name": "Black Bean and Spicy Beef Pasta",
  "subtitle": "Shell pasta with beans, peppers, sweetcorn, and creamy beef ragu",
  "description": "A quick, hearty pasta dish combining spicy beef ragu with black beans, vegetables, cream, cheddar, and parsley.",
  "meal_type": "main",
  "yield": {
